    "body": "### Description\n\nAfter updating to the latest version (v2026.5.22+25), push notifications are only delivered when the app is actively open/foregrounded. When the app is in the background or closed, no push notifications are received.\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Receive a new DM/group message while the app is open → ✅ notification received\n2. Close the app or send it to the background\n3. Receive a new message → ❌ no notification delivered\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nPush notifications should be delivered even when the app is in the background or terminated, as per standard platform push notification behavior (APNs on iOS, FCM on Android).\n\n### Environment\n\n- App version: v2026.5.22+25\n- Platform: iOS\n- OS version: 26.5\n\n### Additional Context\n\nThis was tested with MLS-encrypted DMs via a marmot protocol relay. Messages are delivered correctly when the app is open; the issue is specifically with background/terminated-state push delivery.",
